00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:02.480
- This is what I find interesting.

00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:04.700
You have a duet with Ariana, but you've

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:06.100
known her since she was little, right?

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:07.280
- Since she was seven years old,

00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:09.560
Ariana Grande, there we are.

00:00:09.560 --> 00:00:11.030
We did "Hairspray Live!" together.

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:12.230
I love that child.

00:00:12.230 --> 00:00:13.230
She came back to see "Wicked."

00:00:13.230 --> 00:00:15.681
Her grandma brought her and she said,

00:00:15.681 --> 00:00:17.120
"My granddaughter wants to sing."

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:19.176
And I said, "Oh, well
that's sweet, good luck."

00:00:19.176 --> 00:00:21.940
(laughing)

00:00:21.940 --> 00:00:22.773
- Worldwide superstar.

00:00:22.773 --> 00:00:24.070
- Yeah, I was like, "Okay, we'll see."

00:00:24.070 --> 00:00:27.270
And then she sang something
and I was like, oh.

00:00:27.270 --> 00:00:28.410
I checked myself.
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:28.410 --> 00:00:29.500
- Because she was really good

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:31.290
and I said, "Here's a little wand."

00:00:31.290 --> 00:00:32.700
Because I created the role of Glenda

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:35.290
and I said, "Keep that with
you and have that with you."

00:00:35.290 --> 00:00:36.410
And she kept it all these years.

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:41.140
We've stayed close and I wanted
to bring her in the record

00:00:41.140 --> 00:00:43.750
and we did "You Don't Own Me" Lesley Gore

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:45.540
And I'm so proud of her.

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:46.630
- Yeah.
- I love her.

00:00:46.630 --> 00:00:47.650
- Oh my God, that's so cool,
(clapping) that's so cool.

00:00:47.650 --> 00:00:50.094
- Thank you.

00:00:50.094 --> 00:00:52.237
- It's super, super great.

